ng -6000 is clearly unfavorable), but also on favorable. So skewness is symmetric. The reason cannot clearly identify a more right-skewed lottery. Still, the information needed (outcomes and probabilities) is available, so the reason can be evaluated—though it leads to ambiguity.",
